    "Auto-picked for this Mac's memory (~%@ resident, freed again after idle): the lightest Gemma tier — ahead of every small model across 17 languages (p<0.001), measurably better Russian than MiniCPM5 (p=0.001), and its fix sibling, loaded on first use, restores %lld%% of noisy lines exactly where the small models manage %lld–%lld%%." : {
