    "Auto-picked for this Mac's memory: the best-quality tier that stays within about a quarter of it (~%@ resident, freed again after idle). Ahead of E2B 4-bit across the evaluated languages (p<0.001), level with E2B 8-bit and E4B 8-bit on completions, and its fix sibling restores %lld%% of noisy lines exactly — the most in the catalog. Smaller tiers are one click below if you'd rather spend less memory." : {
