    "Smallest footprint; a trend behind MiniCPM5 on 17 languages (p=0.028), and clearly behind its bigger sibling Qwen3.5 2B (p<0.001)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nejmenší nároky; v 17 jazycích trend za MiniCPM5 (p=0.028) a jasně za větším Qwen3.5 2B (p<0.001)."
